                    Digital Sets New Standard for
                     Multi-Technology Switching


        ... Provides network managers with high-performance,
multi-technology switching at industry's lowest cost of ownership... 


MAYNARD, Mass., September 3, 1996 -- Digital Equipment Corporation 
today introduced advanced switching solutions that offer network 
managers unmatched flexibility to integrate multiple high-speed 
technologies into a cost-effective, multi-gigabit switching system.  
When installed in the DEChub 900 MultiSwitch chassis, the new 
VNswitch 900 and ATMswitch 900 products provide seamless, 
low-latency interconnection among any combination of switched 
technologies.  This unique approach makes it easy for network 
managers to give users high-speed access to servers and campus 
backbones regardless of the underlying network technology. 

     The new products provide high-speed switching among Ethernet, 
Fast Ethernet, FDDI, and ATM. To support this advanced capability, 
the company is introducing a new software-definable switching 
interconnect for the DEChub 900 MultiSwitch that doubles backplane 
bandwidth with a simple firmware upgrade. For maximum flexibility, 
the modules can also be deployed as standalone solutions. 

     Continuing the rollout of the enVISN architecture, the products 
offer a range of leadership switching features such as IP Switching 
and comprehensive VLAN support.  Distributed routing will also be 
available via a firmware upgrade. 

     "Digital's new switching system offers network managers unique 
flexibility to bring the performance benefits of switching to every 
level of their network," said Avi Fogel, vice president of Global 
Marketing for Digital's Network Product Business.  "Our advanced 
switching architecture improves access to local servers, and 
integrates those workgroups with existing Fast Ethernet, FDDI or ATM 
backbone networks easily and cost-effectively.  In addition, these 
same switching benefits are available to existing DEChub 900 
MultiSwitch customers through a simple firmware upgrade.  No other 
vendor offers such painless evolution to so much performance." 

SWITCHES OFFER COST-EFFECTIVE HIGH-PERFORMANCE SOLUTIONS 

     The VNswitch 900 and ATMswitch 900 families are designed to 
deliver both maximum performance and  excellent value. For example, 
within the DEChub 900 MultiSwitch, VNswitch 900 products combine 
high port density with a 1.2 Gb/s multi-technology switching fabric. 
This design not only provides unmatched performance for both packet 
and cell transfer, but also reduces the number of modules needed to 
switch between technologies,  thus lowering the cost of the total 
solution. 

     The switches are also very competitive on a price-per-port 
basis. For Ethernet to ATM connections, the VNswitch 900EA is priced 
from 25 to 50% below offerings from other leading vendors. 
Similarly, the VNswitch 900EX offers Ethernet to Fast Ethernet 
connections at from 10 to 40% less per port than other vendors. 

     "Digital is offering a painless upward migration path into 
state-of-the-art high-speed networking with this announcement," 
commented Nicholas Lippis III, president of Strategic Networks 
Consulting, Inc.  "The power and flexibility inherent in the DEChub 
900 architecture and switching products offers investment protection 
not often found in this industry."

VNswitch 900 Family Offers Multi-Technology Switching

     The VNswitch 900 products deliver high-density switched 
Ethernet connections to Fast Ethernet, FDDI or ATM.  Each module 
provides full wire-speed switching performance and comprehensive 
IEEE-based VLAN support.  In addition, the switches are prepared to 
support IP Switching and distributed routing with a simple firmware 
upgrade. 

The VNswitch 900 family includes:

     o 	VNswitch 900EX -- 12 switched Ethernet ports and two Fast 
        Ethernet ports;  

     o 	VNswitch 900EA -- 12 switched Ethernet ports and one ATM 
        port;  
 
     o 	VNswitch 900EF -- 12 switched Ethernet ports and one FDDI 
        port pair; and
 
     o 	VNswitch 900EE -- 24 switched Ethernet ports. 
 

ATMswitch 900 Products Deliver ATM for Departments

     The ATMswitch 900 products extend to the department and 
workgroup the performance and reliability that the GIGAswitch/ATM 
product brings to the backbone.  They also offer the same software 
and features, including support for IP Switching, FLOWmaster flow 
control, Switched Virtual Circuits, dynamic routing, and ATM 
Forum-compliant LAN emulation (LANE) and rate-based flow control. 
The ATMswitch 900 product family includes:
 

     o 	ATMswitch 900F -- six fixed 155 Mb/s Multi-mode Fiber SC 
        type ports and two front-insertable modular ATM ModPHY 
        interfaces 

     o 	ATMswitch 900T -- six fixed 155 Mb/s UTP-5 ports plus two
     	front-insertable modular ATM ModPHY interfaces 

"FUTURE-PROOF" ARCHITECTURE MAXIMIZES INVESTMENTS

     The new high-speed interconnect for the DEChub 900 MultiSwitch 
highlights the unique benefits of this popular chassis solution. 
Because the interconnect is software defined, customers can take 
advantage of the new switches -- and effectively double their 
aggregate bandwidth to 5.6 Gb/s -- with a simple firmware upgrade. 

     "Digital's architectural design not only provides me more than 
enough bandwidth for my network, it extends the life cycle of my 
network capabilities," said Michael Mullicane, CIO of America II 
Group, Inc. "Digital has once again protected my investment."

     The interconnect supports the VNbus, which provides up to 1.2 
Gb/s of aggregate bandwidth through distributed switching buses for 
the VNswitch modules; native ATM cell transfer across up to six ATM 
155 Mb/s channels; and up to 12 backplane Ethernet channels. 

     "Three years ago Digital delivered the DEChub 900 MultiSwitch 
with the promise that it was 'future ready,'" said Patrick O'Connor, 
Director of Marketing at Pioneer. "This same DEChub 900 will now 
deliver the next generation of leading-edge technology via a simple 
firmware upgrade.  Once again, it proves the value of the DEChub 
design and Digital's foresight and commitment to affordable 
scalability." 

PRODUCT PRICING AND AVAILABILITY 
 
List prices for the new products are:
 
     o  VNswitch 900EX is $8,395  
     o  VNswitch 900EA is $11,195  
     o  VNswitch 900EF is $11,995  
     o  VNswitch 900EE is $8,995  
     o  ATMswitch 900F is $13,995  
     o  ATMswitch 900T is $12,995 

     The VNswitch 900 products will be available in October.  The 
ATMswitch 900F will be available in December; the ATMswitch 900T 
will be available in January. 

     Additional information on Digital's Network Product Business is 
available on the World Wide Web at http://www.networks.digital.com. 

     Digital Equipment Corporation is a world leader in open client/
server solutions from personal computing to integrated worldwide 
information systems.  Digital's scalable Intel and Alpha platforms, 
storage, networking, software and services, together with industry-
focused solutions from business partners, help organizations compete 
and win in today's global marketplace. 
